    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Overlooking a lush open green with serene, uninterrupted views of Lough Atalia, 9 Woodlands Green presents a rare canvas to create your dream family home. \r\n\r\nBuilt in 1964 and spanning 115.45 sq m, this three-bedroom, one-bathroom property sits in one of Renmore’s most cherished, family-centric settings—complete with a children’s playground right on your doorstep. The internal layout offers exceptional versatility for family living, featuring two distinct living rooms and a functional kitchen/dining area. The main front sitting room frames pictures of mature green trees and open space through an expansive picture window, filling the ground floor with warmth and natural light. \r\n\r\nTo the rear, a second cosy living space and an adjacent kitchen/dining area overlook the garden, offering a practical layout ready to be reimagined into a modern, open-plan hub. The home carries a solid D Building Energy Rating (BER), driven by an efficient oil-fired central heating system that provides a strong foundation for future energy upgrades. \r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a generous off-street paved driveway and an attached garage. This garage offers immense potential to convert into a fourth bedroom, playroom, or home office, subject to planning permission. Beyond your front door, you have immediate access to Ballyloughane Beach, local primary schools, Kingfisher Sports Complex, and swift transport links into Galway City Centre. Properties capturing this combination of coastal views and green space are exceptionally rare in Renmore. \r\n\r\nContact our office today to arrange your private viewing and start planning your future here."
      },
